  "description": "Fuaran resolved-style observability feedback channel — type contract, flag DU, observer interface, and shared flag-derivation logic (effective-background composite walk + WCAG contrast). Twin of Fuaran.UI.LayoutObserver.Abstractions: turns resolved colours (foreground, the composited effective background behind it, font role, emitted tone) into a small fixed set of AI-friendly legibility flags (ContrastBelowAA, InvisibleText, AccentIndistinct). Apache-2.0 licensed.",
